  "m2_criterion": {
    "id": "M2_scoped_address_context",
    "definition": "A current rights-cleared real Macao street/civic-address dataset with explicit scope, stable source identifiers or snapshot row identity, source Traditional Chinese/Portuguese fields, observed time, edition, validity semantics, schema and SHA-256 reproducibly produces approved immutable digest-pinned address-context artifacts and passes the actual MO AGID loader/API. Keep local postalCode null and official postal geometry none: CTT form placeholder 000000, doorplate numbers, cadastral identifiers and AGID cells are not official postcodes. House numbers and buildings require explicit permitted source records and relations, not containment, proximity or translated names. Reconcile legacy DSCC and current DSSCU authority from 2026-06-01, item-specific reproduction permission, geometry CRS/scale/topology, duplicate/range/ambiguity/privacy exceptions, transformation and real coverage validation. Synthetic tests, policy pages, HTML shells and a live reference alone never establish M2."
  },
